[{"client_msg_id":"5DE4374B-27CE-426D-9BF3-8111A207D998","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"vim plugを使ってるんですが、deinってやっぱり良いんですか？（ダジャレを言いたいだけ）","ts":"1621770117.087500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3ky"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20d85eab-697b-473a-9449-27d789efc337","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"設定モノリス化計画進行中\n進捗\n• またpackerでハマる\n• 300行程度のinit.luaを作った時Gするとハイライトが死んでる。\u0026lt;C-d\u0026gt;で下がるとちゃんと読み込まれる模様","ts":"1621754496.086100","edited":{"user":"U01U44T1FK2","ts":"1621756960.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EZQ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022XK6AFFE","text":"\u003c@U022XK6AFFE\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621749890.085500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"2fcaf324-2f01-49d6-942b-eb6e59969eaf","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"早いやつでも1-2秒くらいはかかると思う","ts":"1621748896.084600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zOEf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d18dffe-b0a7-4b0f-9217-20c7a40e8e71","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"tsserverとかプロジェクトの規模次第だけど5-10秒起動にかかるんで","ts":"1621748884.084300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ETD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5588adc8-2f2c-45f9-bb32-8d8988af6648","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"モノリスにするのもありっちゃありなんですけど\n普段の開発での分割分割思想をそのまま持ってきてるだけではあります\n\n共同編集だと分割運用、個人用ではモノリス運用がよきなのかな\nたまにファイル構造変えて大工事が始まるので模索中","ts":"1621748859.083700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Jiel"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe7af700-4516-43cd-8d36-4e7aa1b79e57","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あと最近はvim本体の起動が早くてもcocやvim-lspの起動がそのあと裏で非同期に走って待たされるんで、自分はチューニングしてないのもあります","ts":"1621748852.083500","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1621748935.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"abf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95eb34f1-945d-402b-8657-9af1676357b5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"普通にdein使ったら基本はキャッシュされたような","ts":"1621748715.080600","thread_ts":"1621748715.080600","reply_count":2,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"54RUv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f879f74f-b073-4f37-8b9f-f06f5ab265cb","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"キャッシュしてるかどうかって関数callで出力できたりってします?","ts":"1621748695.080000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5E5W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc371352-3d12-454d-8851-aafdfedeffe9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```$ time vi -c \"qa\"\nnvim -c \"qa\"  0.58s user 0.31s system 141% cpu 0.627 total```\n厳しい","ts":"1621748597.078900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qTF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87fd655f-3a79-4518-9b48-57b248a0f08b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"キャッシュした後のパフォーマンスは最高ではって思ってる","ts":"1621748568.078300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j=dT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"514d2dfc-101d-4eb2-bd38-5e28792a0ee8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"tomlの方がパフォーマンス上がることってあるんでしたっけ、そこだけだとパフォーマンス少し落ちるくらいの認識だったんですけど","ts":"1621748535.077800","thread_ts":"1621748535.077800","reply_count":5,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"erR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6af17e9e-1ef0-4b78-9828-48abb81bf72b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"分割してる理由はソートが面倒だからです","ts":"1621748494.076800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hlb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e90b47a-e0d6-4116-af29-461c837bbfdf","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"私は分割してるけど万人に勧められるものでもないし","ts":"1621748479.076500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9QGv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72567f75-de4f-4076-b408-911e4f1a2ab8","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分は3800行のvimrcの1枚運用で困ってないです","ts":"1621748473.076300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FJ4I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f08ddbd-c2d8-4b22-a73b-14ff32db39c4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"tomlでプラグインの設定書くのもなかなか辛いですし","ts":"1621748450.075800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yVTYT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"296d4c2b-0ce6-4fe9-94de-6ae874c61ffc","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"人によりますけど全部1枚のvimrcでもいいんじゃないですかね？","ts":"1621748437.075200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9dC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55434209-eb25-480b-94f7-18e312c719fc","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"各種プラグイン用の設定ファイルをどこにおいて、どの機能を使って読み込むのが最適かっていうのが直近の悩みです","ts":"1621748411.074500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b9y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"62feb5bb-b2a6-4332-ac50-3d4cb7e6f91a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"dein自体は最低限（vim-plugと同等程度）で使うならそこまで難しくはないんですけど、チューニング始めたら沼がすごい","ts":"1621748376.074100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PIRVC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28544978-53e9-4f55-bda6-0eb4193a3a0d","type":"message","user":"U01U44T1FK2","text":"初手からdeinやってましたねw\nShougoさんのプラグインはチューニングカリカリに組めるからそれで一生遊べるなと思ってます","ts":"1621748326.072500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Baa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"253253e5-b9e4-4a36-8c17-ccf748ab1680","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分と \u003c@U7B4ZD49X\u003e さんはプラグイン数が100個オーダーとかなんでチューニングコストが半端ないのはありますが","ts":"1621748314.072300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t9R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a9e6732-d4ea-48ad-bf1a-820c562a1586","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"（プラグインの整理してたら定期的に遅延ロード周りで壊れてハマったりするから自分は諦めてしまった）","ts":"1621748277.071400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PxsgA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94104f27-baba-4360-aed2-97c8026690b2","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"プラグインマネージャーは正直そんなに体験に効いてこないから別のところから攻めた方が体験上がりそうと老婆心","ts":"1621748227.070100","edited":{"user":"U7B4ZD49X","ts":"1621748246.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6zw/b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a28d4f21-9c8b-4d4c-9a03-8cfed1347113","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"いっぱいチューニングできるドン！","ts":"1621748039.069400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z2Zas"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0933880-2750-4ece-828d-7645646e9938","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"deinのチューニングは設定に数日以上は覚悟した方がいいレベル","ts":"1621747973.069100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zTS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"55114777-4f7a-4223-94e9-28d0c70dd393","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"チューニングにはvim-plug不向きですね、シンプルな管理したい人向けだし","ts":"1621747907.068500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/91j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c00f5751-1859-4841-8f62-15b6e0dbe2b2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"チューニングしたいというのならvim-plugをやるのは無駄になる","ts":"1621747876.067800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ns9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02153f1c-5697-451b-8dcd-e4d83e9e5645","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"deinやるにしても遅延ロードは後回しにしてひとまず動かしてから遅延設定かな・・・","ts":"1621747674.067700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qNuC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fad6100d-9f16-4fe9-9ca9-9ec3b6e67b36","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、それをやりたいって書いているならdeinとかでもいいですね","ts":"1621747603.066800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K9DS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f842f408-0baa-4916-b5a0-480bc6fa4e0f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"学習コストを払いたいんじゃないか","ts":"1621747581.066400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aZIH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bfe043cd-322a-4314-a2b2-9e010a0d47b4","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"遅延読み込みをチューニングしたいと書いてあるから","ts":"1621747572.066300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fxFz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71f62e0d-2372-404b-bd5b-e498a8f3402b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"大したことしてないのでvim-plugに戻そうかなと思うことがたまにある","ts":"1621747549.066200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"swD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bde43cce-8acb-4f16-899b-346a715fa363","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"払う覚悟があるんならいいんですけど、初手で使うのはおすすめできないです","ts":"1621747541.066000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DhAZb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c06cbe5-c8a3-42e9-bbe1-0e7a8395c186","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"deinもpackerも学習コストが高い","ts":"1621747523.065500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"ty